cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite these texts, cite the release of this repository you used (its
  version, and its DOI when one is given) and the printed PTS edition (volume
  and page). corrections.json changes between releases; the corrections are
  recorded there with their sources.
type: dataset
title: "pts-gretil-ng: PTS Pali texts from GRETIL, proofread"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible build of the Pali Text Society editions as given by GRETIL
  (digital input by the Dhammakaya Foundation), with proofreading corrections
  against the scans of the printed editions marked in the text, and
  corrections of the editions published by the PTS (Cone, Jackson, Pruitt,
  the corrigenda of the volumes)
  applied and marked, with the printed reading they replace.
